       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI56406.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI56406.                                    *
      *                                                                *
      *     Anulação da reconciliação
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC  X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI56406         '.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5606 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD5808 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD8201 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5640.
       COPY SWCV5641.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0010.
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY AQCW0005.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT7204                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.
           05 CON-SWVT5808                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5808'.
           05 CON-SWVT5606                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT5606'.
           05 CON-SWVT8201                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8201'.

           05 CON-PD                       PIC  X(02) VALUE 'PD'.
           05 CON-DATA-MIN                 PIC  9(08) VALUE 00010101.
           05 CON-P                        PIC  X(01) VALUE 'P'.
           05 CON-O00                      PIC  X(03) VALUE 'O00'.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-IDRECONC                  PIC S9(13) COMP-3.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI56406'.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC  X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI56406         '.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0004.

           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5640-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5640-ASE               TO SWCV5641-ASE.

       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5640-ADE               TO SWCV5641-ADE.

           PERFORM 2100-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2199-VALIDACOES-EXIT

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-MODIFICA-DADOS
                 THRU 2299-MODIFICA-DADOS-EXIT
           END-IF
           .
       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-VALIDACOES
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-VALIDACOES.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2199-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2200-MODIFICA-DADOS
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-MODIFICA-DADOS.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-MODIFICA-DADOS'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * IDRECONC a anular
           MOVE SWCV5640-IDRECON           TO WS-IDRECONC.

      * Mov Internos
           PERFORM 2210-MODIFICA-SWT72
              THRU 2210-MODIFICA-SWT72-EXIT.

      * Mov Extracto
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2220-MODIFICA-SWT58
                 THRU 2220-MODIFICA-SWT58-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Operações
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2230-MODIFICA-SWT56
                 THRU 2230-MODIFICA-SWT56-EXIT
           END-IF.

      * Reconciliacoes
           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2240-APAGA-SWT82
                 THRU 2240-APAGA-SWT82-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2299-MODIFICA-DADOS-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2210-MODIFICA-SWT72
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2210-MODIFICA-SWT72.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2210-MODIFICA-SWT72'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC.
           MOVE CON-PD                     TO SWCD7204-CCODEST.
           MOVE CON-O00                    TO SWCD7204-CNIVREC.
           MOVE CON-P                      TO SWCD7204-CTIPREC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD7204-CNATREC.

           MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I        TO SWCD7204-CUSERID.

           PERFORM 2211-UPD-SWT72
              THRU 2211-UPD-SWT72-EXIT.

       2210-MODIFICA-SWT72-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2211-UPD-SWT72
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2211-UPD-SWT72.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2210-MODIFICA-SWT72' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7204
                 SET IDRECONC =  :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
                   , CCODEST  =  :SWCD7204-CCODEST
                   , CNIVREC  =  :SWCD7204-CNIVREC
                   , CTIPREC  =  :SWCD7204-CTIPREC
                   , CNATREC  =  :SWCD7204-CNATREC
                   , CUSERID  =  :SWCD7204-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  =  CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE IDRECONC =  :WS-IDRECONC
           END-EXEC.


           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-OPREF-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNORD-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-OPREF-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNORD-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNORD-CAPLIC
              ELSE
                 IF NOT DB2-OK
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           ELSE
              MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
              MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
           END-IF.

       2211-UPD-SWT72-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2220-MODIFICA-SWT58
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2220-MODIFICA-SWT58.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2220-MODIFICA-SWT58'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD5808-IDRECONC.
           MOVE CON-DATA-MIN               TO SWCD5808-DATREC.
           MOVE CON-PD                     TO SWCD5808-CCODEST.
           MOVE CON-O00                    TO SWCD5808-CNIVREC.
           MOVE CON-P                      TO SWCD5808-CTIPREC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5808-CNATREC.

           MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I        TO SWCD5808-CUSERID.

           PERFORM 2221-UPD-SWT58
              THRU 2221-UPD-SWT58-EXIT.

       2220-MODIFICA-SWT58-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2221-UPD-SWT58
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2221-UPD-SWT58.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2221-UPD-SWT58'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT5808
                 SET IDRECONC = :SWCD5808-IDRECONC
                   , DATREC   = :SWCD5808-DATREC
                   , CCODEST  = :SWCD5808-CCODEST
                   , CNIVREC  = :SWCD5808-CNIVREC
                   , CTIPREC  = :SWCD5808-CTIPREC
                   , CNATREC  = :SWCD5808-CNATREC
                   , CUSERID  = :SWCD5808-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE IDRECONC = :WS-IDRECONC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5808               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                 CONTINUE
      *          MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
      *            TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
      *             MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
      *               TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-S
      *             MOVE SWCK0001-OPREF-N-EXISTS
      *               TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-MSG
      *             MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
      *               TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-CAPLIC
      *             MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
      *               TO SWCV5641-MRNORD-S
      *             MOVE SWCK0001-OPREF-N-EXISTS
      *               TO SWCV5641-MRNORD-MSG
      *             MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
      *               TO SWCV5641-MRNORD-CAPLIC
              ELSE
                 IF NOT DB2-OK
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           ELSE
              MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
              MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
           END-IF.

       2221-UPD-SWT58-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2230-MODIFICA-SWT56
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2230-MODIFICA-SWT56.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2230-MODIFICA-SWT58'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD5606-IDRECONC.
           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCD5606-DATREC.
           MOVE CON-PD                     TO SWCD5606-CCODEST.
           MOVE CON-O00                    TO SWCD5606-CNIVREC.
           MOVE CON-P                      TO SWCD5606-CTIPREC.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD5606-CNATREC.

           MOVE VIAL0001-CUTILIZA-I        TO SWCD5606-CUSERID.

           PERFORM 2231-UPD-SWT56
              THRU 2231-UPD-SWT56-EXIT.

       2230-MODIFICA-SWT56-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2231-UPD-SWT56
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2231-UPD-SWT56.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2231-UPD-SWT56'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT5606
                 SET IDRECONC = :SWCD5606-IDRECONC
                   , DATREC   = :SWCD5606-DATREC
                   , CCODEST  = :SWCD5606-CCODEST
                   , CNIVREC  = :SWCD5606-CNIVREC
                   , CTIPREC  = :SWCD5606-CTIPREC
                   , CNATREC  = :SWCD5606-CNATREC
                   , CUSERID  = :SWCD5606-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE IDRECONC = :WS-IDRECONC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT5606               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                 CONTINUE
      *          MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
      *            TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
      *             MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
      *               TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-S
      *             MOVE SWCK0001-OPREF-N-EXISTS
      *               TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-MSG
      *             MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
      *               TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-CAPLIC
      *             MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
      *               TO SWCV5641-MRNORD-S
      *             MOVE SWCK0001-OPREF-N-EXISTS
      *               TO SWCV5641-MRNORD-MSG
      *             MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
      *               TO SWCV5641-MRNORD-CAPLIC
              ELSE
                 IF NOT DB2-OK
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           ELSE
              MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
              MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
           END-IF.

       2231-UPD-SWT56-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2240-APAGA-SWT82
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2240-APAGA-SWT82.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2240-APAGA-SWT82'      TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           PERFORM 2241-DEL-SWT82
              THRU 2241-DEL-SWT82-EXIT.

       2240-APAGA-SWT82-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2241-DEL-SWT82
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2241-DEL-SWT82.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2241-DEL-SWT82'        TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EXEC SQL
              DELETE SWVT8201
               WHERE IDRECONC = :WS-IDRECONC
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                 MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                   TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-OPREF-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNOPR-CAPLIC
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNORD-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-OPREF-N-EXISTS
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNORD-MSG
                    MOVE SWCK0002-CAPLIC
                      TO SWCV5641-MRNORD-CAPLIC
              ELSE
                 IF NOT DB2-OK
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                      TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
                 END-IF
              END-IF
           ELSE
              MOVE VIAK0002-ABEND-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
              MOVE VIAK0001-ERRO-DB2
                TO VIAL0002-COD-ERRO-GRAVE
           END-IF.

       2241-DEL-SWT82-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5641-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5641-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5641-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0010.
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY AQCP0005.
